# App states

Full spec: **[docs/app-states.md](../docs/app-states.md)** · Layout stability: **[docs/layouts.md](../docs/layouts.md)**

## Route-level

- Use App Router **`loading.tsx`**, **`error.tsx`**, **`not-found.tsx`**, **`forbidden.tsx`** — thin re-exports from module when possible.
- Skeleton geometry **matches** final page (Tier 1 + Tier 2 stable across navigations).

## In-page API

- **`ServiceResponse` `failed`** — validation/business (not route forbidden).
- **`ServiceResponse` `error`** — system fault + retry UI.
- **`loading`** is **`isPending`**, not a response status.

